x & = \\\\ (\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{14}{6})x & = \\\\ (\\frac{1+14}{6})x & = \\\\ (\\frac{15}{6})x & = \\\\ \\frac{5}{2}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the expression simplifies to $\\frac{5}{2}x.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186612439 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "206585a5-5932-5ce5-8c92-82eca0054b62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{13}{4}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186611773} {:answer/id #uuid "2d1708ac-0eca-59d7-bc37-6685683f2e4e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{11}{4}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186611803} {:answer/id #uuid "4b452ece-f9db-57cf-836d-7b6af951dcd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{8}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186611862} {:answer/id #uuid "bcdf79c5-a141-52c5-aa7e-4abc72bd0ae9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{13}{8}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612097} {:answer/id #uuid "d348c4c4-b7c3-5447-bbac-958f4d5d5ab2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{11}{8}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612150}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bcdf79c5-a141-52c5-aa7e-4abc72bd0ae9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{13}{8}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612097} :answer-field/id #uuid "dc31dd27-c57d-5955-93bb-906a95cf6986" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612380}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "60fbebd3-e94f-5503-b0b6-d856b7e416b6" :question/math-academy-id "q-109203" :question/problem "Simplify the expression $\\frac{5}{4}z+\\frac{3}{8}z.$" :question/worked-solution "We combine the like terms by adding the coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5}{4}z+\\frac{3}{8}z & = \\\\ (\\frac{5}{4}+\\frac{3}{8})z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn order to add the coefficients, we have to convert them to have the same denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\frac{5}{4}+\\frac{3}{8})z & = \\\\ (\\frac{10}{8}+\\frac{3}{8})z & = \\\\ (\\frac{10+3}{8})z & = \\\\ \\frac{13}{8}z & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the expression simplifies to $\\frac{13}{8}z.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186612440 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4e29f858-ae3c-58a9-a05a-16e4b6ec71b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5x-2y+\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186611866} {:answer/id #uuid "594c9b8d-b652-5183-a29d-bae30e4a58a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5x+y+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186611889} {:answer/id #uuid "5a449c64-e08d-5131-acd8-1a500bb45a2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x-3y+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186611891} {:answer/id #uuid "b6a31186-b254-53c8-8457-a0c8ba2f3a0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5x-3y+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612079} {:answer/id #uuid "d632bc3a-516c-5e2c-a5c4-2ec70f7d8953" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10x+3y+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612159}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b6a31186-b254-53c8-8457-a0c8ba2f3a0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5x-3y+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612079} :answer-field/id #uuid "1e77ce0b-1621-5c18-a6f7-a1f0d8dde5b8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612268}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "6107ee77-23cc-5b1d-9a06-ae014ccb6b5d" :question/math-academy-id "q-2300" :question/problem "$\\frac{1}{2}(10x-6y+4)+1=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we apply the distributive law:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}(10x-6y+4)+1 & = \\\\ (\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 10x-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 6y+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4)+1 & = \\\\ \\frac{10x}{2}-\\frac{6y}{2}+\\frac{4}{2}+1 & = \\\\ 5x-3y+2+1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we collect and combine the like terms, simplifying the coefficients as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}5x-3y+2+1 & = \\\\ 5x-3y+(2+1) & = \\\\ 5x-3y+3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186612443 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ca91284-3bc6-5afc-a687-11d7cb4a4870" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186611736} {:answer/id #uuid "10db4de1-ed11-5842-9bac-baaad693728f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{6}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186611744} {:answer/id #uuid "cf343071-01a0-5161-b9b1-5d35f9c7a07b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612134} {:answer/id #uuid "e947ba64-2640-5d9b-85e2-73e38d465247" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612196} {:answer/id #uuid "ef648960-f27b-53bf-aed7-4712eaff737e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186612212}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "10db4de1-ed11-5842-9bac-baaad693728f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{6}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186611744} :answer-field/id #uuid "3f5aa22c-443d-5c6b-92ae-6372cc0c74de" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/i