field-1}}\n$p\\,-$\n{{field-2}}\n$q\\,-$\n{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "We rearrange the terms so that the like terms, $18p$ and $9p$, are together.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}18p-6q-9p-1 & = \\\\ \\underbrace{18p-9p}_{a\\text{ terms}}-6q-1 & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we combine the like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\underbrace{18p-9p}-6q-1 & = \\\\ (18-9)p-6q-1 & = \\\\ 9\\,p-6\\,q-1\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186618781 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "26a2ff6c-f24a-55b9-bae0-c57d27cfc711" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}-1}{p}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618273} {:answer/id #uuid "2bd7917b-c6d3-57f7-ad82-92081e9f3541" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}-1}{p+1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618280} {:answer/id #uuid "813f375d-2e42-5213-861d-5fb77961ce81" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}+1}{p}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618396} {:answer/id #uuid "8ab22567-b025-502d-b4db-bcb51130296f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}-1}{p-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618406} {:answer/id #uuid "c387da92-035f-5abd-a658-e9dc9f460802" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}+1}{p-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618497}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "26a2ff6c-f24a-55b9-bae0-c57d27cfc711" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}-1}{p}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618273} :answer-field/id #uuid "ca3ae777-4722-5f57-892c-9c57589f1d0b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618683}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "b0d9b444-988d-5751-8148-056b5b63c476" :question/math-academy-id "q-111084" :question/problem "Rationalize the denominator of $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{p+1}+1}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, note that the denominator's conjugate is $\\sqrt{p+1}-1.$\n\nNow, to rationalize the denominator, we multiply both the numerator and denominator by the conjugate $\\sqrt{p+1}-1,$ and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{p+1}+1} & = \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{p+1}+1}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}-1}{\\sqrt{p+1}-1} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}-1}{(\\sqrt{p+1}+1)(\\sqrt{p+1}-1)} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}-1}{(\\sqrt{p+1})^{2}-{1}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}-1}{p+1-1} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{p+1}-1}{p} & \\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186618789 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e2fe70d-b6c2-5672-9d47-51959bdffc23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2p+q+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618223} {:answer/id #uuid "1bab23aa-b7fd-5063-a192-225f1f2778fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-p-q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618251} {:answer/id #uuid "3bacad13-2789-5946-a52c-e8baa56a44e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "p+1+q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618300} {:answer/id #uuid "4a879ab0-e212-5bec-864c-d5fd1abc6677" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "p-q-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618323} {:answer/id #uuid "aa459d32-3e1e-5932-9f49-4a8de620c022" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2p-q-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618458}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "aa459d32-3e1e-5932-9f49-4a8de620c022" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2p-q-1" :db/id #edb/ref 175